  <StreamGeometry x:Key="Icon.PanelRight">M5 3 H19 A2 2 0 0 1 21 5 V19 A2 2 0 0 1 19 21 H5 A2 2 0 0 1 3 19 V5 A2 2 0 0 1 5 3 Z M15 3 V21</StreamGeometry>
  <!-- Chevrons (Lucide chevron-first/left/right/last): pagination first/prev/next/last. -->
